    "detailed_description": "Cranky Chibi Cthulhu is a vertical scrolling SHMUP Inspired by classic Arcade and NES games of the 80s. Loosely based on the writings of H.P. Lovecraft, you take on the role of a green chibi-horror from deep under the sea. Someone has foolishly disturbed your slumber and you have awakened... CRANKY and ready to kick whomever is responsible for such an act of defiance!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEpic boss encounters and challenging difficulty will await those that take on the role of our cranky, yet lovable protagonist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Retro style pixel art.<br />\r\n\u2022 An original chiptune music soundtrack.<br />\r\n\u2022 6 Stages of challenging SHMUP Arcade action. <br />\r\n\u2022 Dozens of unique enemies to keep your SHMUP thumbs glued to your controller.<br />\r\n\u2022 Unique eldritch inspired bosses, each with multi-level forms and distinctive attacks.<br />\r\n\u2022 Gameplay inspired by nostalgia but with fair and rewarding gameplay.<br />\r\n\u2022 Single player, local co-op and leaderboard to relive your Arcade bragging days.<br />\r\n\u2022 Secrets and multiple endings.",
    "about_the_game": "Cranky Chibi Cthulhu is a vertical scrolling SHMUP Inspired by classic Arcade and NES games of the 80s. Loosely based on the writings of H.P. Lovecraft, you take on the role of a green chibi-horror from deep under the sea. Someone has foolishly disturbed your slumber and you have awakened... CRANKY and ready to kick whomever is responsible for such an act of defiance!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEpic boss encounters and challenging difficulty will await those that take on the role of our cranky, yet lovable protagonist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Retro style pixel art.<br />\r\n\u2022 An original chiptune music soundtrack.<br />\r\n\u2022 6 Stages of challenging SHMUP Arcade action. <br />\r\n\u2022 Dozens of unique enemies to keep your SHMUP thumbs glued to your controller.<br />\r\n\u2022 Unique eldritch inspired bosses, each with multi-level forms and distinctive attacks.<br />\r\n\u2022 Gameplay inspired by nostalgia but with fair and rewarding gameplay.<br />\r\n\u2022 Single player, local co-op and leaderboard to relive your Arcade bragging days.<br />\r\n\u2022 Secrets and multiple endings.",
